    "7oPxZuUXBF4": {
      "result": "awaiting_reconstruction",
      "notes": "All 50 saved states and captions reviewed. Complete eleven-piece staircase setup: White Kb3/Qf6/Ne6/f4/g4 versus Black Kh7/Qg8/Rb6/b5/f3/g5. The queen zigzags with checks, displaces the queen through Qh1+/Qh7 and coordinates a knight fork. Even the final Qxb6 ending retains eight pieces.",
